  "title": "macOS: Tahoe / Liquid Glass icon updates",
  "description": "Liquid Glass icon support requires an asset file built with Xcode 26,\nbut doesn't require that we build the rest of the application with Xcode\n26. Add a suitable asset file to the repository and remove a bunch of\nconditional checks added in 430cdda6c2. We no longer use the old icon on\nmacOS, so remove those no-longer-needed resources.\n\nPing #18131",
